{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24638","headline":"对新家醖翫自种花 · 白居易","name":"对新家醖翫自种花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香麴亲看造，芳丛手自栽。\n迎春报酒熟，垂老看花开。\n红蜡半含萼，绿油新醱醅。\n玲珑五六树，潋灩两三杯。\n恐有狂风起，愁无好客来。\n独酣还独语，待取月明回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}